   - Measures performance on training data

2. Validation Accuracy:
   - Measures generalization ability

3. Training/Validation Loss:
   - Lower loss indicates better learning

4. Confusion Matrix:
   - Shows correct and incorrect predictions

5. Sample Predictions:
   - Visual verification of model predictions

6. Overfitting Check:
   - Large gap between training and validation
     accuracy indicates overfitting

7. Underfitting Check:
   - Low training and validation accuracy
     indicates underfitting
=========================================================
""")
